## What the patch is
The byte-exact forward diff `git diff 754b2f1 79031dc -- <touched_paths>` (the
whole commit). It splits one dual-method POST/PUT handler into two route
handlers sharing three extracted helpers, and removes a now-unused
`parse_optional_int` helper. It does not change routes, auth, or validation.

